WEBVTT

01:50.090 --> 01:53.950
[Love Between Lines]

01:54.300 --> 01:56.690
[Episode 28]

02:54.840 --> 02:56.300
The weather is nice today.

02:56.320 --> 02:57.380
Perfect for a date.

03:01.520 --> 03:02.490
But...

03:03.100 --> 03:04.960
I still need to find inspiration.

03:10.370 --> 03:10.880
Let's go.

03:10.880 --> 03:12.210
I'll take you to a place.

03:18.050 --> 03:19.380
My mom and I have decided

03:19.520 --> 03:20.920
to leave next Wednesday.

03:22.190 --> 03:23.190
So soon?

03:25.360 --> 03:26.520
There are some houses there

03:26.520 --> 03:27.920
and paperwork to handle.

03:28.470 --> 03:30.730
I might need to stay longer than planned.

03:33.280 --> 03:34.310
During this time,

03:34.579 --> 03:35.780
move back to my place.

03:36.400 --> 03:37.630
It's convenient for going to work.

03:37.630 --> 03:39.290
And I'll leave the car for you.

03:40.910 --> 03:41.590
Besides,

03:42.840 --> 03:44.680
I'll feel better knowing my plants

03:44.680 --> 03:46.000
are in your hands.

03:46.430 --> 03:47.079
Also,

03:49.680 --> 03:50.870
that way, when I get back,

03:50.870 --> 03:52.530
I'll get to see you right away.

03:54.680 --> 03:56.340
So I'm your free gardener now?

03:57.840 --> 03:58.430
Alright.

03:58.590 --> 03:59.390
For the sake of

03:59.520 --> 04:00.770
the big house,

04:01.280 --> 04:02.740
I'll reluctantly say yes.

04:05.350 --> 04:06.410
Then it's settled.

04:11.240 --> 04:13.290
Will you miss me?

04:16.560 --> 04:17.600
Probably not.

04:18.630 --> 04:20.140
After all, I'll have

04:20.310 --> 04:21.310
a king size bed

04:21.560 --> 04:22.360
all to myself.

04:25.070 --> 04:26.600
Then promise
you won't secretly move out again,

04:26.600 --> 04:27.160
okay?

04:27.880 --> 04:29.610
That depends on your behavior.

04:30.680 --> 04:31.870
If you dare

04:31.870 --> 04:33.800
hit on some blonde beauty over there...

04:33.800 --> 04:35.870
Speaking of that,
I just remembered something.

04:35.870 --> 04:37.560
My mom said

04:37.720 --> 04:39.560
there's a very friendly...

04:43.120 --> 04:45.920
70-year-old Cuban man
living next to our new home.

04:49.159 --> 04:50.480
Then you'd better let him teach you

04:50.480 --> 04:51.409
the salsa dance.

04:52.870 --> 04:54.000
Salsa?

04:54.430 --> 04:55.159
It's a...

04:55.350 --> 04:56.680
very passionate dance.

04:57.870 --> 04:58.530
Can you dance?

04:58.530 --> 04:59.330
Show me.

05:07.440 --> 05:08.390
Like this.

05:19.750 --> 05:20.480
Salsa...

05:23.370 --> 05:29.230
♪ Life lays out the outline of my scenes ♪

05:30.470 --> 05:33.940
♪ The last act
was a monologue in a dream ♪

05:35.140 --> 05:38.909
♪ And in the next,
I wander through the city's noise ♪

05:40.070 --> 05:43.140
♪ So many arrivals
that turned out to be nothing ♪

05:44.720 --> 05:48.370
♪ I'm counting the beats of the clock ♪

05:49.430 --> 05:53.230
♪ I can't tell which platform
is for leaving or returning ♪

05:54.100 --> 05:58.370
♪ Until you walk toward me ♪

05:59.550 --> 06:03.380
♪ And my breath softens ♪

06:02.630 --> 06:04.900
I brought you here
to find some inspiration.

06:04.900 --> 06:09.280
♪ I forget every absurd line ♪

06:05.270 --> 06:06.600
This is your first
independent project proposal.

06:06.600 --> 06:07.530
Are you nervous?

06:10.050 --> 06:14.030
♪ Because of you ♪

06:11.240 --> 06:11.920
Yes.

06:12.630 --> 06:13.830
But I'm more excited.

06:14.980 --> 06:21.810
♪ Every pose looks so ridiculous
and helpless ♪

06:18.510 --> 06:19.830
I once heard a saying,

06:20.930 --> 06:23.390
"Humans kiss the earth with architecture."

06:23.920 --> 06:25.720
"Every edge and curve"

06:25.970 --> 06:30.270
♪ This question is so simple and plain,
but hard for me to explain ♪

06:26.310 --> 06:28.480
"is our love letter to this world."

06:31.360 --> 06:35.830
♪ Why is this feeling so
foreign yet reliable? ♪

06:31.720 --> 06:32.560
I just can't wait

06:32.560 --> 06:33.800
to write mine.

06:36.220 --> 06:38.159
♪ We brushed past each other
under the trees in my dream ♪

06:38.190 --> 06:40.050
♪ After waking, petals cover the balcony ♪

06:40.130 --> 06:45.060
♪ If love's an agreed accident, I imagine
you in every alternate universe ♪

06:45.140 --> 06:47.890
♪ Whoosh, in the cycle of memories ♪

06:48.390 --> 06:52.110
♪ I lost the voice of reason ♪

06:54.700 --> 07:00.840
♪ Lay bare all the flaws,
then gentle grace befalls ♪

07:01.860 --> 07:06.540
♪ I travel through the four seasons
and sea of people ♪

07:07.300 --> 07:12.250
♪ And fall into
this anticipation called "you" ♪

07:12.860 --> 07:16.220
♪ Because of you ♪

07:17.380 --> 07:23.810
♪ So you're beside the story
written by fate ♪

07:18.070 --> 07:18.630
Look.

07:21.560 --> 07:22.630
From this angle,

07:23.000 --> 07:24.360
people look bigger than the stones.

07:23.990 --> 07:25.410
♪ Oh, okay ♪

07:25.310 --> 07:27.120
The scale of a building is relative.

07:26.010 --> 07:28.020
♪ Oh, okay ♪

07:28.920 --> 07:30.920
♪ Oh, okay ♪

07:29.360 --> 07:30.160
It's like

07:30.430 --> 07:32.070
the lattice windows in Suzhou gardens.

07:31.300 --> 07:33.030
♪ Oh, okay ♪

07:32.600 --> 07:33.920
Through visual references,

07:33.570 --> 07:35.310
♪ Oh, okay ♪

07:33.920 --> 07:35.680
they can frame

07:35.720 --> 07:38.830
♪ Oh, okay, my love ♪

07:35.830 --> 07:36.920
a distant tower

07:37.430 --> 07:38.760
within the window view.

07:39.070 --> 07:39.750
Not bad.

07:39.750 --> 07:41.070
You've been reading a lot at home.

07:40.090 --> 07:43.950
♪ It turns out you're my exception ♪

07:59.750 --> 08:02.160
How come you're more serious
about designing here than at home?

08:02.160 --> 08:04.360
I've always been thinking about designing.

08:04.360 --> 08:05.630
Do you want to hear about it?

08:05.630 --> 08:06.120
Sure.

08:08.360 --> 08:11.120
These are different areas
of the cultural center.

08:11.120 --> 08:12.310
This is a café.

08:12.310 --> 08:13.560
This is a bookstore.

08:13.560 --> 08:14.620
This is the lounge.

08:14.800 --> 08:16.480
I want to fill this place with trees

08:16.480 --> 08:18.410
to create a tropical natural vibe,

08:18.720 --> 08:19.830
turning the building

08:19.830 --> 08:21.680
into an urban oasis.

08:23.950 --> 08:24.480
Here.

08:30.270 --> 08:31.870
Let me use your hand for a sec.

08:33.120 --> 08:33.750
This

08:33.750 --> 08:35.549
is the exterior wall.

08:35.789 --> 08:37.450
But the wall can't be too high.

08:37.600 --> 08:38.870
That way,

08:38.950 --> 08:40.880
the whole visual field stays open,

08:41.000 --> 08:42.320
and people

08:42.320 --> 08:44.440
can still feel close to nature

08:44.440 --> 08:46.390
inside the building.

08:47.320 --> 08:48.750
Why don't you use your own hand?

08:48.750 --> 08:49.750
Yours is bigger,

08:49.750 --> 08:51.150
and the proportions are perfect.

08:51.150 --> 08:53.680
It's perfect
for modeling the exterior wall.

08:54.000 --> 08:54.630
Fine,

08:54.630 --> 08:55.630
Ms. Designer Hu.

08:56.320 --> 08:57.200
Where else

08:57.200 --> 08:58.360
can I be of service?

09:01.840 --> 09:02.720
Let me see.

09:03.440 --> 09:06.790
This is the jogging path
next to the leisure center.

09:08.000 --> 09:09.510
Going further up,

09:11.120 --> 09:12.920
I remember there's an overpass.

09:14.080 --> 09:15.720
Going up the overpass,

09:17.200 --> 09:17.800
you can see

09:17.960 --> 09:20.870
the city's utility network
that runs everywhere.

09:25.600 --> 09:27.030
Turn left ahead.

09:35.750 --> 09:36.840
There's a lake.

09:41.750 --> 09:44.510
And an... ecological floating island.

09:44.870 --> 09:45.510
Perfect.

09:54.360 --> 09:55.440
Don't frown.

09:55.440 --> 09:58.040
You're affecting the flatness
of the terrain.

10:14.240 --> 10:16.150
Geological movement detected.

10:19.000 --> 10:20.000
Ms. Designer Hu,

10:20.600 --> 10:21.670
can you add

10:22.030 --> 10:23.690
a seismic isolation bearing?

10:25.910 --> 10:27.080
Sure, no problem.

10:29.720 --> 10:31.120
Installation complete.

10:54.840 --> 10:56.370
Isn't your flight tonight?

10:56.390 --> 10:58.000
Why are you going back so soon?

10:58.000 --> 10:59.600
I'm going back to pack first.

10:59.720 --> 11:01.920
Then I'll head straight to the airport.

11:03.000 --> 11:05.150
You'll have to handle things here alone.

11:05.150 --> 11:05.670
Don't worry.

11:05.670 --> 11:06.600
I'll keep you updated

11:06.600 --> 11:08.200
on everything at the studio.

11:15.120 --> 11:16.180
Bye-bye, Mr. Xiao.

11:17.510 --> 11:17.910
Bye-bye.

11:17.910 --> 11:18.970
Bye-bye, Mr. Xiao.

11:19.320 --> 11:21.120
Have a safe trip. Come back soon.

11:38.390 --> 11:38.930
By the way,

11:38.930 --> 11:41.060
who's attending the meeting tonight?

12:02.200 --> 12:03.660
Did you forget something?

12:06.260 --> 12:10.210
♪ I moved closer to you,
and you moved closer to me ♪

12:10.360 --> 12:14.090
♪ The motionless night began to shimmer ♪

12:14.670 --> 12:18.950
♪ The fireworks bear witness, as if ♪

12:19.210 --> 12:22.440
♪ They're waiting for the words
we want to say ♪

12:22.900 --> 12:26.190
♪ I moved closer to you,
and you moved closer to me ♪

12:27.400 --> 12:32.680
♪ It felt as if two lonely islands
had finally ♪

12:33.200 --> 12:37.810
♪ Gotten closer and slipped into
the flow of time together ♪

12:40.000 --> 12:45.680
♪ I didn't expect to meet you,
but I care about you ♪

12:43.670 --> 12:44.720
I'll miss you.

12:48.230 --> 12:54.900
♪ You are like the stars,
illuminating my silence ♪

12:51.550 --> 12:52.200
Bye.

12:55.960 --> 12:56.550
Alright.

12:56.310 --> 13:03.530
♪ Secretly remembering,
every little thing in my day is about you ♪

13:01.930 --> 13:02.860
I'm leaving now.

13:03.720 --> 13:07.780
♪ Our heartbeats fall into sync ♪

13:07.870 --> 13:11.670
♪ We intersect quietly,
drawn to each other ♪

13:11.700 --> 13:15.640
♪ How long have we waited
to grow familiar from strangers? ♪

13:15.740 --> 13:19.840
♪ Destiny made me cross paths with you ♪

13:20.590 --> 13:23.230
♪ I feel your gentle healing ♪

13:23.280 --> 13:29.240
♪ Traveling together
is the best thing in life ♪

13:30.100 --> 13:33.990
♪ I moved closer to you,
and you moved closer to me ♪

13:34.150 --> 13:38.240
♪ The motionless night began to shimmer ♪

13:38.350 --> 13:42.490
♪ The fireworks stand as our witnesses,
as if ♪

13:42.930 --> 13:46.170
♪ They're listening to our story ♪

13:46.510 --> 13:49.800
♪ I moved closer to you,
and you moved closer to me ♪

13:50.800 --> 13:56.550
♪ It felt as if two lonely islands
had finally ♪

13:56.760 --> 14:02.250
♪ Held hands and slipped into
the flow of time together ♪

14:03.000 --> 14:06.370
♪ I won't wander anymore ♪

14:37.270 --> 14:39.320
So this is why

14:40.690 --> 14:42.140
he rushed back.

14:59.320 --> 15:00.550
I thought that since Xiao Zhiyu left,

15:00.550 --> 15:01.840
we'd get to see each other more.

15:01.840 --> 15:03.650
But he's been gone a week already...

15:03.650 --> 15:05.080
It's half a month.

15:05.440 --> 15:06.550
Fine.

15:07.000 --> 15:07.840
He's been gone for half a month,

15:07.840 --> 15:09.360
and we haven't met once.

15:09.910 --> 15:11.120
Well, I've been busy.

15:11.120 --> 15:13.230
This proposal is really important to me.

15:13.230 --> 15:14.230
I have to win it.

15:14.720 --> 15:15.870
Alright, you go ahead with your work.

15:15.870 --> 15:17.790
I'll keep checking out
new store locations.

15:17.790 --> 15:19.120
Are you okay on your own?

15:19.320 --> 15:21.870
I'll come join you
after I finish with the proposal.

15:21.870 --> 15:22.930
Who said I'm alone?

15:23.070 --> 15:24.400
I'm hanging up now. Bye.

15:32.470 --> 15:34.190
That store we just saw was great.

15:34.190 --> 15:35.030
It's spacious.

15:35.030 --> 15:36.750
You could run murder mystery games

15:36.750 --> 15:37.810
of any scale there.

15:37.840 --> 15:38.360
Plus,

15:38.360 --> 15:39.480
if you sign today,

15:39.480 --> 15:41.340
you'll get one month's rent free.

15:42.940 --> 15:43.490
But...

15:43.670 --> 15:44.910
Most importantly,

15:44.910 --> 15:45.440
it's just

15:45.440 --> 15:47.030
a few steps from the store

15:47.200 --> 15:48.120
your girlfriend likes.

15:48.120 --> 15:49.240
Super convenient.

15:49.440 --> 15:49.930
You...

15:50.320 --> 15:50.910
Well...

15:51.440 --> 15:52.240
My boyfriend

15:52.240 --> 15:53.080
is a businessman,

15:53.080 --> 15:54.150
not a philanthropist,

15:54.150 --> 15:55.000
right?

15:55.360 --> 15:56.620
The space in that store

15:56.720 --> 15:57.630
is quite large,

15:57.960 --> 15:59.550
but the location is too out of the way.

15:59.550 --> 16:01.670
There isn't much foot traffic there.

16:02.120 --> 16:03.550
It's obviously a place
that's hard to lease out.

16:03.550 --> 16:05.950
There's no way
we'll take it at a high price.

16:06.030 --> 16:06.600
Well...

16:06.750 --> 16:07.150
Yes.

16:07.440 --> 16:08.500
I'll listen to you.

16:09.360 --> 16:10.200
How about this?

16:10.200 --> 16:12.120
Let's check with other agents

16:12.120 --> 16:13.080
and compare the options.

16:13.080 --> 16:13.320
Okay.

16:13.320 --> 16:14.550
Let's think it over some more.

16:14.550 --> 16:14.960
Sorry.

16:14.960 --> 16:15.550
Wait, wait.

16:15.550 --> 16:16.390
Sir, ma'am.

16:16.550 --> 16:16.840
I...

16:17.030 --> 16:17.790
Excuse me.

16:18.600 --> 16:19.150
Is it

16:19.150 --> 16:20.150
about the price?

16:21.320 --> 16:22.440
The price is negotiable.

16:22.440 --> 16:23.270
Really.

16:29.560 --> 16:31.150
Thanks to your quick reaction earlier,

16:31.150 --> 16:32.480
we got such a good price.

16:33.720 --> 16:35.120
Money shouldn't be wasted.

16:35.120 --> 16:36.580
Every penny saved counts.

16:37.080 --> 16:37.650
Yes.

16:39.270 --> 16:40.440
Did Xiao Zhiyu

16:40.440 --> 16:41.480
really leave

16:41.750 --> 16:42.480
everything to you with this new store

16:42.480 --> 16:43.750
and stay completely out of it?

16:43.750 --> 16:44.390
I just want to try

16:44.390 --> 16:45.960
doing it on my own this time.

16:46.320 --> 16:47.390
I just didn't expect us

16:47.390 --> 16:48.850
to end up neighbors again.

16:51.840 --> 16:53.080
Honestly,

16:53.390 --> 16:54.870
I had my own selfish reasons

16:54.870 --> 16:56.730
for helping you bargain just now.

17:01.360 --> 17:03.320
I'm used to being neighbors with you,

17:03.320 --> 17:05.050
and I don't want that to change.

17:05.109 --> 17:06.240
It's actually nice.

17:11.680 --> 17:12.550
Besides,

17:12.880 --> 17:14.440
you're a big client of mine.

17:18.790 --> 17:20.750
So when are you signing the contract?

17:20.750 --> 17:21.240
Why?

17:21.640 --> 17:22.920
I'll go with you.

17:24.109 --> 17:24.829
This time,

17:25.160 --> 17:26.550
I plan to focus more

17:26.550 --> 17:28.280
on experience and perception,

17:28.400 --> 17:29.480
rather than sticking to the earlier idea

17:29.480 --> 17:31.310
of ecological
and architectural coexistence.

17:31.310 --> 17:32.640
Instead, the buildings

17:32.640 --> 17:34.640
grow out of the oasis themselves.

17:35.160 --> 17:36.510
So this design balances coverage

17:36.510 --> 17:38.880
with residents' needs
for natural activity spaces.

17:38.880 --> 17:40.940
The research results were positive.

17:41.110 --> 17:42.950
Let's take a short break.

17:48.510 --> 17:48.920
About the greenery,

17:48.920 --> 17:50.590
do you have

17:50.850 --> 17:52.250
any other design options

17:52.480 --> 17:54.270
or alternative plans?

17:56.920 --> 17:57.590
Wait for me.

17:58.060 --> 17:58.990
Do you want some?

18:28.960 --> 18:29.680
Ms. Zhou.

18:30.240 --> 18:31.160
Take a break.

18:31.790 --> 18:34.350
Even in the final stretch,
you need to take care of your health.

18:34.350 --> 18:35.200
It's fine.

18:35.200 --> 18:36.480
I'll summarize their feedback

18:36.480 --> 18:38.070
and make adjustments right away.

18:38.070 --> 18:38.880
Don't be so nervous.

18:38.880 --> 18:40.200
You've already done a great job.

18:40.200 --> 18:41.480
Just present it like this

18:41.480 --> 18:42.270
when you meet the client.

18:42.270 --> 18:43.070
It'll be fine.

18:44.810 --> 18:47.140
Come on,
let's go outside and get some air.

18:59.400 --> 19:00.550
Oh right, what is this?

19:00.550 --> 19:02.080
The designers' group chat.

19:02.510 --> 19:03.640
Why am I not in it?

19:04.120 --> 19:05.110
Everyone, come.

19:05.110 --> 19:07.640
This is a treat
from Mr. Xiao for our hard work.

19:08.240 --> 19:09.310
Mr. Xiao is so thoughtful.

19:09.310 --> 19:11.190
He's all the way in the US
and still thinking of us.

19:11.190 --> 19:12.360
Share them around.

19:13.540 --> 19:14.200
Take a look.

19:15.470 --> 19:17.920
We've received your warm gesture,
Mr. Xiao.

19:17.920 --> 19:19.110
Everyone is happy.

19:19.590 --> 19:20.680
But it's already this late.

19:20.680 --> 19:22.140
Why aren't you asleep yet?

19:25.830 --> 19:26.480
Soon.

19:27.550 --> 19:28.610
Before I go to sleep,

19:28.610 --> 19:30.010
do you have 3 words to say?

19:40.370 --> 19:41.850
Just sleep early.

19:48.000 --> 19:49.400
I also have 3 words to say.

19:49.590 --> 19:51.030
They're on the little cake I got for you,

19:51.030 --> 19:51.590
the one in the pink box.

19:51.590 --> 19:53.640
Look, I got a pink one.

19:54.720 --> 19:55.070
Look.

19:55.880 --> 19:56.470
Sun!

19:56.970 --> 19:58.100
Sun! Don't eat that!

19:59.160 --> 20:00.290
Why? Is it poisoned?

20:01.620 --> 20:02.440
Can you take another one?

20:02.440 --> 20:03.400
I want this one.

20:04.030 --> 20:05.400
What's the difference anyway?

20:05.400 --> 20:06.730
What's the difference?

20:07.860 --> 20:08.820
I like pink.

20:10.700 --> 20:11.440
Fine, you can have it.

20:11.440 --> 20:12.680
You can have this.

20:12.680 --> 20:13.310
This one's good too.

20:13.310 --> 20:14.400
Give me this one. Yes.

20:14.400 --> 20:15.200
This one.

20:15.950 --> 20:16.830
And this one.

20:17.510 --> 20:18.270
Can you get it for me?

20:18.270 --> 20:19.000
Get it for me.

20:19.160 --> 20:19.880
What flavor is this?

20:19.880 --> 20:20.640
Let's take a photo together.

20:20.640 --> 20:21.720
Yes, let's take a photo.

20:21.720 --> 20:22.310
Send it to Mr. Xiao.

20:22.310 --> 20:23.030
Take a photo.

20:22.680 --> 20:23.890
[Go for it]

20:23.030 --> 20:24.090
Let's take a photo.

20:24.380 --> 20:24.830
Okay.

20:25.240 --> 20:26.110
It's recording.

20:26.110 --> 20:27.200
Let's say something to Mr. Xiao.

20:27.200 --> 20:27.830
Ready, go.

20:27.830 --> 20:28.890
-Okay.
-Get ready.

20:29.130 --> 20:29.480
Start.

20:29.480 --> 20:30.270
You speak.

20:30.270 --> 20:31.160
Mr. Xiao,

20:31.350 --> 20:33.070
go for it! Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

20:33.070 --> 20:33.830
So cool!

20:33.830 --> 20:34.920
Mr. Xiao, you're so cool.

20:34.830 --> 20:37.670
[Speechless]

20:35.400 --> 20:36.530
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

20:37.150 --> 20:38.990
You've motivated us.

20:39.160 --> 20:39.830
Come on, for Mr. Xiao.

20:39.830 --> 20:41.510
Mr. Xiao, you're awesome.
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

20:41.510 --> 20:42.070
Good.

20:42.070 --> 20:43.440
Mr. Xiao, you're so cool!

20:43.440 --> 20:44.000
So cool!

20:44.000 --> 20:45.400
-Thank you, Mr. Xiao.
-Thanks, Mr. Xiao.

20:45.400 --> 20:46.240
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

20:46.240 --> 20:47.030
Mr. Xiao,

20:47.030 --> 20:48.440
we're all working really hard.

20:48.440 --> 20:49.750
Please take care of yourself, Mr. Xiao.

20:49.750 --> 20:50.880
Work hard, eat well.

20:50.880 --> 20:51.830
We've received the treats.

20:51.830 --> 20:53.070
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

20:59.180 --> 21:00.730
How about one more?

21:11.590 --> 21:12.480
Go to sleep.

21:13.000 --> 21:14.550
Don't you need to confirm the design plan

21:14.550 --> 21:16.010
with the client tomorrow?

21:16.230 --> 21:17.510
I can't sleep.

21:19.160 --> 21:20.680
The bed is too big.

21:22.480 --> 21:23.480
When I left,

21:23.480 --> 21:25.540
didn't you say the bed was just right?

21:27.070 --> 21:28.960
That's because you were holding me.

21:28.960 --> 21:29.680
Now,

21:30.880 --> 21:31.940
half of it is empty.

21:38.550 --> 21:39.480
Xiao Zhiyu,

21:40.190 --> 21:41.190
I was wrong.

21:43.350 --> 21:44.030
What?

21:44.350 --> 21:46.550
Is there a problem with the design plan?

21:47.480 --> 21:48.960
When I said before

21:49.510 --> 21:50.910
that I wouldn't miss you,

21:51.880 --> 21:53.810
I was just pretending to be strong.

21:55.480 --> 21:58.610
When we are watching movies
and variety shows together,

21:59.200 --> 22:01.590
I don't even want to skip the end credits.

22:02.960 --> 22:05.110
On my way home from work,
passing a convenience store,

22:05.110 --> 22:06.880
I instinctively

22:07.440 --> 22:09.310
grab the mint candies you like.

22:10.110 --> 22:13.640
Even when the weather forecast says
there'll be rain tomorrow,

22:14.880 --> 22:17.080
I want to remind you to take an umbrella.

22:22.240 --> 22:23.160
Xiao Zhiyu,

22:24.300 --> 22:26.670
I think I seriously underestimated

22:27.400 --> 22:29.400
how much space you take up in my life.

22:33.960 --> 22:34.960
Even now,

22:36.090 --> 22:38.090
being able to look at you like this,

22:40.000 --> 22:41.590
I still miss you.

22:45.590 --> 22:46.450
Go to the study.

22:47.110 --> 22:47.830
The desk.

22:48.110 --> 22:49.400
The drawer on the far left.

22:49.400 --> 22:50.160
Open it.

23:02.400 --> 23:03.160
This one?

23:16.030 --> 23:17.790
"Architecture in Love"?

23:21.240 --> 23:23.400
Compared to static spatial relationships,

23:23.400 --> 23:24.310
I believe more

23:24.790 --> 23:26.640
in crossing every time zone

23:26.790 --> 23:27.480
to see you.

23:28.590 --> 23:29.000
When...

23:29.000 --> 23:30.110
When did you...

23:30.590 --> 23:31.400
On the day

23:31.680 --> 23:33.340
you said you wouldn't miss me.

23:41.680 --> 23:42.590
It's getting late.

23:42.590 --> 23:43.440
Go to sleep.

23:44.160 --> 23:45.210
Tomorrow's proposal

23:45.210 --> 23:46.610
will surely go smoothly.

24:09.200 --> 24:11.270
I want to create
a community cultural space

24:11.270 --> 24:13.730
that grows naturally from its environment.

24:13.880 --> 24:16.110
The circular building forms
are soft and inclusive,

24:16.110 --> 24:18.760
and the irregular windows
act like picture frames,

24:18.760 --> 24:20.170
letting people inside

24:20.200 --> 24:21.860
experience different views.

24:22.880 --> 24:23.920
I want it to be

24:24.160 --> 24:25.480
not just a building,

24:25.640 --> 24:27.160
but an exploration

24:27.160 --> 24:28.820
of future urban public space.

24:29.090 --> 24:30.490
Using nature as a medium,

24:30.790 --> 24:32.070
culture as the core,

24:32.240 --> 24:33.700
and community as the soil,

24:34.030 --> 24:35.350
it grows into

24:35.350 --> 24:36.590
a green micro-settlement

24:36.590 --> 24:37.510
in the city's fabric—

24:37.510 --> 24:38.440
a place to rest,

24:38.440 --> 24:40.200
communicate, and co-create.

24:44.750 --> 24:45.270
Ms. Hu,

24:45.590 --> 24:47.000
I really like your proposal.

24:47.000 --> 24:47.730
And I'm happy

24:48.030 --> 24:50.160
to entrust the project to your studio.

24:50.920 --> 24:52.520
Thank you for your approval.

24:53.350 --> 24:54.000
Ms. Zhou.

24:54.590 --> 24:55.930
I'd like to briefly go over

24:55.930 --> 24:57.920
the next steps for the collaboration
with you.

24:57.920 --> 24:58.920
Okay, no problem.

24:59.160 --> 24:59.890
So, Ms. Zhou,

25:00.270 --> 25:01.030
I'll...

25:01.030 --> 25:01.810
Go back first.

25:01.810 --> 25:03.540
See you at the office tomorrow.

25:04.400 --> 25:05.200
Great job.

25:08.740 --> 25:10.340
Everything went well today.

25:11.180 --> 25:13.240
The client really liked my proposal.

25:13.560 --> 25:16.400
And Ms. Zhou is already talking to them
about the contract.

25:16.400 --> 25:17.460
I'm not surprised.

25:19.720 --> 25:20.520
What's wrong?

25:20.790 --> 25:22.070
It's raining today.

25:22.600 --> 25:24.200
I happen to have an umbrella.

25:26.830 --> 25:28.430
It's raining over there too?

25:28.880 --> 25:31.480
Shouldn't it be early morning there
right now?

25:31.750 --> 25:32.960
Why are you out?

25:36.070 --> 25:37.330
Why aren't you saying anything?

25:37.330 --> 25:38.170
Where are you?

25:40.110 --> 25:41.120
Scattered showers.

25:41.120 --> 25:42.980
Remember to bring me an umbrella.

25:46.740 --> 25:52.000
♪ I didn't expect to meet you,
but I care about you ♪

25:54.870 --> 26:00.500
♪ You are like the stars,
illuminating my silence ♪

26:03.040 --> 26:10.060
♪ Secretly remembering,
every little thing in my day is about you ♪

26:10.560 --> 26:14.150
♪ Our heartbeats fall into sync ♪

26:14.590 --> 26:18.400
♪ We intersect quietly,
drawn to each other ♪

26:18.420 --> 26:22.250
♪ How long have we waited
to grow familiar from strangers? ♪

26:22.420 --> 26:26.850
♪ Destiny made me cross paths with you ♪

26:27.260 --> 26:29.640
♪ I feel your gentle healing ♪

26:29.770 --> 26:36.120
♪ Traveling together
is the best thing in life ♪

26:36.740 --> 26:40.690
♪ I moved closer to you,
and you moved closer to me ♪

26:40.740 --> 26:41.430
Congratulations.

26:41.110 --> 26:44.840
♪ The motionless night began to shimmer ♪

26:45.170 --> 26:49.450
♪ The fireworks stand as our witnesses,
as if ♪

26:47.030 --> 26:48.720
When did you get back?

26:49.710 --> 26:52.940
♪ They're listening to our story ♪

26:50.310 --> 26:51.510
On the night

26:51.760 --> 26:53.310
you said you really missed me.

26:52.970 --> 26:56.920
♪ I moved closer to you,
and you moved closer to me ♪

26:57.340 --> 27:01.070
♪ The motionless night began to shimmer ♪

27:01.450 --> 27:05.730
♪ The fireworks stand as our witnesses,
as if ♪

27:05.860 --> 27:09.440
♪ They're waiting for the words
we want to say ♪

27:09.600 --> 27:12.890
♪ I moved closer to you,
and you moved closer to me ♪

27:13.660 --> 27:19.540
♪ It felt as if two lonely islands
had finally ♪

27:19.750 --> 27:24.750
♪ Held hands and slipped into
the flow of time together ♪

27:25.810 --> 27:29.300
♪ I won't wander anymore ♪

27:38.030 --> 27:40.270
You promised to go to the office today.

27:44.390 --> 27:45.720
I can manage it on my own.

28:09.680 --> 28:10.650
I knew it.

28:12.160 --> 28:13.820
Why did you fall asleep again?

28:15.150 --> 28:15.920
I wasn't sleeping.

28:15.920 --> 28:17.720
-I… I sat for a while.
-Alright.

28:17.720 --> 28:18.270
Alright.

28:18.270 --> 28:19.530
You weren't sleeping.

28:29.290 --> 28:29.730
Here.

28:41.960 --> 28:43.490
Brush your teeth properly.

28:53.310 --> 28:54.240
Smells so good.

28:57.920 --> 28:58.270
Here.

29:00.400 --> 29:02.510
Where do you want to go today?
I'll go with you.

29:02.510 --> 29:03.510
Anywhere is fine.

29:03.740 --> 29:05.000
As long as I'm with you.

29:12.700 --> 29:13.700
Did you hear that?

29:23.910 --> 29:26.110
Where did that little kitten come from?

29:28.310 --> 29:29.200
Xiao Zhiyu!

29:32.960 --> 29:34.160
There's a kitten.

29:35.240 --> 29:37.190
It looks like a stray cat
that ran in from outside.

29:37.190 --> 29:39.320
I'll call property management to ask.

29:40.750 --> 29:41.720
They said

29:41.720 --> 29:43.060
it's probably an abandoned kitten.

29:43.060 --> 29:44.320
You must be so thirsty.

29:49.960 --> 29:51.370
Are you afraid of cats?

29:52.440 --> 29:53.000
No.

29:53.810 --> 29:54.610
So you...

29:54.640 --> 29:55.600
don't like cats?

29:58.200 --> 29:58.830
I've just

29:58.980 --> 30:00.240
never had a pet before.

30:00.480 --> 30:02.280
I don't know how to be around one.

30:02.880 --> 30:04.720
Have you never thought about

30:04.830 --> 30:07.110
having a cat or a dog of your own?

30:09.270 --> 30:10.160
Once you form a bond,

30:10.160 --> 30:11.830
you have to face loss someday.

30:12.590 --> 30:13.640
So it's better not to form

30:13.640 --> 30:15.640
that kind of bond in the first place.

30:20.370 --> 30:21.170
What about me?

30:21.920 --> 30:22.880
I'm a bond too.

30:23.170 --> 30:24.230
You're different.

30:24.610 --> 30:25.330
Why?

30:26.030 --> 30:27.510
Because I'm special?

30:29.560 --> 30:30.960
Because you're not a pet.

30:32.270 --> 30:33.270
That trick again.

30:37.830 --> 30:38.750
When I was little,

30:38.750 --> 30:40.350
we had a dog.

30:40.880 --> 30:42.280
We kept it for many years.

30:42.480 --> 30:43.610
Its name was Qiuqiu.

30:44.920 --> 30:47.580
Later, when I was in high school,
it passed away.

30:50.000 --> 30:51.530
Were you sad for a long time?

30:55.280 --> 30:56.850
But that's just how life is.

30:57.480 --> 30:58.440
Whether

30:58.440 --> 31:00.640
it's pets or people,

31:01.790 --> 31:04.590
they can only walk with you
for part of the journey.

31:04.960 --> 31:06.750
Once you understand that,

31:06.750 --> 31:09.150
you won't be afraid
of many things anymore.

31:10.310 --> 31:11.070
Xiao Zhiyu,

31:11.560 --> 31:13.640
can we keep this kitten?

31:15.510 --> 31:17.400
I'm not trying to pressure you.

31:18.400 --> 31:19.680
If you don't like it,

31:20.360 --> 31:21.550
I'll send it to Zhao.

31:21.550 --> 31:22.270
Alright.

31:23.830 --> 31:24.590
I think

31:25.070 --> 31:26.160
I'll like coming home

31:26.160 --> 31:28.270
and seeing you and the kitten.

31:40.830 --> 31:41.750
Is it sleepy?

31:42.720 --> 31:44.160
Its little paws are pink.

31:48.530 --> 31:49.210
Hu Xiu,

31:49.750 --> 31:52.480
congratulations
on landing your first project.

31:56.240 --> 31:56.720
Come on.

31:56.720 --> 31:57.750
We've prepared

31:57.460 --> 32:01.760
♪ Under the streetlight,
I grow increasingly weary ♪

31:57.750 --> 31:59.480
drinks and snacks to celebrate.

31:59.480 --> 32:00.200
Come on.

32:03.550 --> 32:08.390
♪ A few specks of dust
drift by in the wind ♪

32:09.960 --> 32:11.030
They're on the food.

32:10.670 --> 32:14.830
♪ The girl who once
basked in the sunlight ♪

32:11.160 --> 32:11.960
It's okay, it's okay.

32:11.960 --> 32:13.030
Take them off.

32:13.160 --> 32:14.220
It doesn't matter.

32:14.920 --> 32:16.680
She did an amazing job yesterday.

32:15.510 --> 32:18.430
♪ Where did she go to play? ♪

32:17.270 --> 32:19.000
Too bad that you, as the boss,

32:18.870 --> 32:21.850
♪ I don't understand either ♪

32:19.150 --> 32:20.810
didn't get to see it in person.

32:23.750 --> 32:24.830
It's a pity,

32:24.080 --> 32:27.910
♪ Flicking through old chat logs ♪

32:25.830 --> 32:26.960
but my witnessing it

32:26.990 --> 32:28.400
isn't that important.

32:29.960 --> 32:31.440
She doesn't need anyone's approval

32:30.160 --> 32:35.050
♪ I just realized the replies
were somewhat delayed ♪

32:31.610 --> 32:32.760
to prove her worth,

32:33.750 --> 32:34.960
and she doesn't need anyone's attention

32:34.960 --> 32:36.090
to give her meaning.

32:36.190 --> 32:42.180
♪ At the crossroads of choices,
amidst the bustling crowd ♪

32:37.030 --> 32:37.920
She exists,

32:38.440 --> 32:39.200
she grows,

32:40.030 --> 32:41.960
and she becomes who she wants to be.

32:43.000 --> 32:44.480
That alone is already beautiful enough.

32:43.410 --> 32:50.680
♪ Who hasn't paid the price
and still fallen short? ♪

32:45.030 --> 32:45.880
How about we take a photo together?

32:45.880 --> 32:47.160
-Let's do it.
-Okay.

32:48.160 --> 32:49.290
Let's take a selfie.

32:50.700 --> 32:55.250
♪ Stay with me tonight,
look at the starlights ♪

32:53.960 --> 32:56.160
Three, two, one.

32:56.060 --> 33:02.110
♪ Even if the plot is changed dramatically
by fate again ♪

32:56.160 --> 32:57.680
Cheese!

33:02.800 --> 33:09.010
♪ I know the dark clouds will still come ♪

33:09.550 --> 33:17.900
♪ But in this world,
there will always be someone ♪

33:18.620 --> 33:21.900
♪ Who looks forward
with the same hope as me ♪

33:43.640 --> 33:45.240
Let's go to that shop from last time.

33:45.240 --> 33:46.960
The one
where we celebrated Hu Xiu's onboarding.

33:46.960 --> 33:47.480
What do you think?

33:47.480 --> 33:48.030
I agree.

33:48.030 --> 33:48.880
Let's come full circle.

33:48.880 --> 33:49.350
What do you mean by that?

33:49.350 --> 33:50.110
I've called a cab.
Who's sharing it with me?

33:50.110 --> 33:51.030
This is just the beginning,

33:51.030 --> 33:51.830
you know?

34:03.160 --> 34:04.120
Come on, get in.

34:11.170 --> 34:12.489
Aren't we going to eat?

34:13.550 --> 34:14.280
Don't worry.

34:14.360 --> 34:15.690
Someone else is paying.

34:16.170 --> 34:17.440
I gave them my card.

34:18.760 --> 34:19.960
What do you want to do?

34:20.920 --> 34:21.550
Elope.

34:28.400 --> 34:28.960
We've done

34:28.960 --> 34:30.590
a full inspection of this area.

34:30.590 --> 34:31.670
The floor drains, waterproofing—

34:31.670 --> 34:33.110
everything has been properly installed.

34:33.110 --> 34:34.280
Please sign here to confirm.

34:34.280 --> 34:34.920
Okay.

34:37.920 --> 34:38.760
Okay. Thank you for your hard work.

34:38.760 --> 34:39.110
Alright.

34:39.110 --> 34:39.920
Thank you, Mr. Xiao.

34:39.920 --> 34:40.230
Thanks.

34:40.230 --> 34:41.630
Okay. We'll be going now.

35:00.900 --> 35:01.860
258 meters.

35:03.490 --> 35:06.220
This is the tallest building
I've ever designed.

35:07.110 --> 35:07.670
What do you think?

35:07.670 --> 35:08.550
Do you li—

35:19.510 --> 35:20.770
Seems like you love it.

35:37.030 --> 35:41.580
♪ Close your eyes for me ♪

35:43.100 --> 35:45.270
♪ Don't rush to wake up ♪

35:45.750 --> 35:48.970
♪ Before the night ends ♪

35:51.850 --> 35:57.170
♪ Will you stay with me? ♪

35:54.960 --> 35:56.890
So this is what you called eloping?

35:57.360 --> 35:59.590
Eating convenience store food

35:58.090 --> 36:00.090
♪ I won't search for ♪

36:00.400 --> 36:01.760
on top of an unopened skyscraper?

36:00.890 --> 36:03.700
♪ The reason we met ♪

36:03.150 --> 36:05.840
I carefully picked these out downstairs
just now.

36:05.510 --> 36:11.040
♪ The city gradually turns pale
outside the window ♪

36:10.280 --> 36:11.110
For the sake

36:11.280 --> 36:12.840
of 258 meters,

36:12.420 --> 36:14.540
♪ The stars twinkle ♪

36:13.390 --> 36:14.190
cheers to you.

36:15.530 --> 36:19.540
♪ I've quieted down ♪

36:15.550 --> 36:16.670
Then here's to

36:17.030 --> 36:18.760
our first high-altitude date.

36:21.270 --> 36:24.470
♪ What kind of story will you like? ♪

36:24.590 --> 36:26.250
♪ Would you join me? ♪

36:26.280 --> 36:30.040
♪ To make a long, romantic dream ♪

36:30.760 --> 36:33.330
♪ Just you and me ♪

36:34.510 --> 36:35.480
How about we

36:35.960 --> 36:37.360
come back here once a year from now on?

36:36.050 --> 36:38.230
♪ Briefly, beyond the clamor ♪

36:38.260 --> 36:40.240
♪ Carefully drawing close to you ♪

36:38.440 --> 36:39.880
Even if this becomes

36:40.070 --> 36:41.110
a fancy office building someday,

36:40.270 --> 36:43.710
♪ Clinging to that trace of unknown joy ♪

36:41.710 --> 36:43.840
let's still find a way to sneak up here.

36:44.150 --> 36:47.840
♪ Oh, special night ♪

36:45.150 --> 36:45.710
Okay.

36:46.400 --> 36:47.200
I promise you.

36:50.900 --> 36:55.590
♪ I need you maybe ♪

36:50.920 --> 36:51.800
Actually,

36:53.150 --> 36:54.440
as the lead designer,

36:56.150 --> 36:57.400
I have permanent access

36:56.880 --> 36:58.880
♪ The crowds are gone ♪

36:57.400 --> 36:59.000
to the top observation deck.

36:59.560 --> 37:03.090
♪ My thoughts have sunk to the bottom ♪

37:01.710 --> 37:03.710
You should've said that earlier. I...

37:03.710 --> 37:05.550
I thought this was our only chance.

37:05.210 --> 37:10.340
♪ Maybe you never noticed me at all ♪

37:10.960 --> 37:11.670
I was

37:11.670 --> 37:12.760
just thinking

37:12.050 --> 37:17.590
♪ Yet you're in my view ♪

37:13.510 --> 37:16.510
how nice it would be if this moment
could last forever.

37:19.200 --> 37:21.740
♪ Escape the world ♪

37:19.800 --> 37:21.070
I'm not like you.

37:21.770 --> 37:23.770
♪ Forget all things ♪

37:23.790 --> 37:27.150
♪ And fall down a long, romantic dream ♪

37:25.760 --> 37:27.170
As long as you're by my side,

37:27.170 --> 37:29.480
♪ Just you and me ♪

37:28.920 --> 37:30.480
I'll always look forward to tomorrow.

37:30.170 --> 37:32.490
♪ Under moonlight ♪

37:34.850 --> 37:37.420
♪ Briefly, beyond the clamor ♪

37:37.460 --> 37:39.360
♪ Getting closer to you secretly ♪

37:39.380 --> 37:43.230
♪ Clinging to that trace of unknown joy ♪

37:43.620 --> 37:47.630
♪ Oh, special night ♪

37:46.670 --> 37:48.190
Let's take a photo here.

37:49.190 --> 37:49.760
Sure.

37:49.890 --> 37:51.610
♪ Escape the world ♪

37:50.550 --> 37:51.080
Let's go.

37:51.650 --> 37:53.500
♪ Forget all things ♪

37:53.550 --> 37:56.910
♪ And fall down a long, romantic dream ♪

37:54.590 --> 37:55.070
Come on.

37:56.930 --> 37:59.240
♪ Just you and me ♪

37:58.590 --> 37:59.070
Here.

37:59.930 --> 38:02.250
♪ Under moonlight ♪

38:04.610 --> 38:07.180
♪ Briefly, beyond the clamor ♪

38:07.220 --> 38:09.120
♪ Getting closer to you secretly ♪

38:09.140 --> 38:12.990
♪ Clinging to that trace of unknown joy ♪

38:13.200 --> 38:17.210
♪ Oh, special night ♪

38:20.430 --> 38:24.700
♪ We will meet tomorrow ♪

38:25.820 --> 38:27.130
♪ I know ♪

38:27.740 --> 38:31.980
♪ Oh, special night ♪

38:35.170 --> 38:38.580
♪ Oh, special night ♪

41:19.670 --> 41:20.840
So it's a new story?

41:21.590 --> 41:23.050
You'll know when you go in.

41:27.030 --> 41:28.480
It's your first time being a player today.

41:28.480 --> 41:29.280
Try to be fully engaged.

41:29.280 --> 41:31.540
Help me spot issues during the beta test.

41:32.430 --> 41:34.110
This Hu Xiu.

41:34.710 --> 41:36.570
She stood us up at the last minute.

41:37.840 --> 41:39.670
The project's in its final stage.

41:39.670 --> 41:40.840
As the lead designer,

41:40.840 --> 41:42.500
it's normal for her to be busy.

42:32.550 --> 42:33.920
Welcome to Rongcheng.

42:34.030 --> 42:35.000
It's a new world.

42:36.590 --> 42:38.000
Embrace your destiny.
